; abnf stdio.semio.value mutations (REAL binary payload, upgraded from the old print_op-bytes-
; verbatim shortcut)
; format u8 + tag u8 (SemioValueMutation variant ordinal, 0-7, same order as the text facet's
; keyword list) fixed header, then the variant's own recursive path/key/value/id payload as one
; opaque OCTET chain -- real LEB128-varint Rust-side encoding, opaque only at this description
; layer. See ../📝️text/📖️.grammar.semio for the equivalent tag-prefixed text shape.
document = format tag payload
format = OCTET
tag = OCTET
payload = *OCTET
